{"id":"5732","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5732_main_nimbostratus-praecipitatio-pannus-alstostratomutatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是一个极佳的雨层云实例，持续的降雨使其呈弥散状。到拍摄本照片时小到中雨（25毫米）持续了6个多小时，而在之后9小时又有29毫米的降雨。</p>\n<p>由于降雨以及估计在60米（200英尺）高的密布碎片云层，因而无法看到云底。雨层云似乎从内部被照亮，且有适量的漫射光照射到云表面。这表明在云的下部没有小云滴，使光线能够穿透更厚的云层。这是雨层云在下雨时的一个常见特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Edward Engelbrecht","location":"南非，比勒陀利亚，阿奎拉大街，瓦特克卢夫里奇公交站，","latitude":"纬度: 25° 48' 39'' S","longitude":"经度: 28° 14' 45'' E","date":"17 March 2016 0800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.6.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.6.4"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5732_syn_nimbostratus-praecipitatio-pannus-alstostratomutatus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>地面槽向南延伸并到达该国内陆以东地区。南非北部部分地区出现了高空（300 hPa）高压单体。由于沿该国东海岸的脊地面高压单体反气旋旋转，湿空气在该国平流输送。在拍摄图片时的风向为北东北。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016 南非气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5732_upper_nimbostratus-praecipitatio-pannus-alstostratomutatus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从地面到对流层顶高水汽含量， 500-380 hPa达到饱和。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016 南非气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5732_sat_nimbostratus-praecipitatio-pannus-alstostratomutatus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>EUMETSAT信道9红外云图</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2016","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}